435	     * derived from server-side state rather than stored columns (the {@code bulkSignupWarning} and
436	     * {@code capacityWarning} flags, the {@code identityKey} and the {@code possibleDuplicate} pair),
437	     * and re-applies the owner's
438	     * {@code membershipLevel} through the controller ({@link #membershipLevel(Owner)}). Both the
439	     * create endpoint and the single-owner read endpoint return their owner through this method, so
440	     * an owner is decorated identically on either path and each derived field is computed in exactly
441	     * one place.
